# Generated at runtime by notion_app/mcp_config.py's write_mcp_json() —
# contains the raw Notion token in plain text once a token is saved. Never
# commit this, unlike aw-app-mcp-tools's own root mcp.json (which carries no
# secret and IS tracked).
/mcp.json
